    "title": "Gilford influencer may be first in state charged under new 'deepfake' law - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By GABRIEL PERRY, The Laconia Daily Sun ,\n10 hours ago A Gilford motorcyclist may be the first in New Hampshire to be prosecuted under a new law making creation of “deepfakes” a crime. Jaxen Cole, 21, was indicted on Sept. 19, on two felony charges of fraudulent use of deepfakes, a crime created by the state Legislature which went into effect on Jan. 1. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
